' ==============================================================================
' 3-1-unideal-student-UC.puml
'
' Svrha:    Student i kuponi: pretraga, karta, favoriti, kuponi, recenzije i obavijesti (UC-2.4, UC-4.1, UC-4.2, UC-4.4, UC-5.1 – UC-5.4).
' Autor:    Elide Babić
' AI:       Nacrt je izrađen uz pomoć alata Claude prema uputama autorice;
'           autorica ga je iscrtala, provjerila prema specifikacijama u 3.2 i
'           odgovara za sadržaj.
'
' Diagram level: System Requirements
' Diagram type:  Use Case Diagram
' ==============================================================================

@startuml
' Smjer veza (predavanja, slajd 24): aktivni akter -> obrazac, obrazac -> pasivni akter.
title UniDeal – pretraga, kuponi i recenzije (Slika 3.4)
left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #212529

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #212529
    BackgroundColor<<external system>> #FFF3CD
    BorderColor<<external system>> #856404
}

skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #E7F1FF
    BorderColor #0D6EFD
}

actor "Posjetitelj" as Visitor
actor "Student" as Student
actor "Partner" as Partner

actor "Vremenski okidač" as Timer <<external system>>
actor "Google Maps API" as Maps <<external system>>
actor "Resend\n(e-mail)" as Mail <<external system>>

' Student može sve što i posjetitelj.
Student -|> Visitor

rectangle "Sustav UniDeal" {
    (UC-4.1\nPretraga i\nfiltriranje ponuda) as UC41
    (UC-4.2\nPregled partnera\nna karti) as UC42
    (UC-4.4\nSpremanje u favorite) as UC44
    (UC-2.4\nPraćenje kategorija\ni partnera) as UC24
    (UC-5.1\nGeneriranje kupona\nza ponudu) as UC51
    (UC-5.3\nPregled povijesti\nkupona) as UC53
    (UC-5.4\nOcjenjivanje\npartnera) as UC54
    (UC-5.2\nPotvrda korištenja\nkupona) as UC52
}

Visitor --> UC41
Visitor --> UC42

Student --> UC44
Student --> UC24
Student --> UC51
Student --> UC53

' Ocjena se ostavlja iz povijesti kupona, za iskorišten kupon.
UC53 <.. UC54 : <<extend>>\n[kupon iskorišten]

Partner --> UC52

' Vremenski okidač sam šalje podsjetnik tri dana prije isteka ponude.
Timer --> UC24
UC24 --> Mail
UC42 --> Maps
@enduml
